# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# Types:
#   feat      New user-facing functionality
#   fix       Bug fix
#   docs      Documentation only
#   style     Formatting with no behavior change
#   refactor  Code change with no feature or bug fix
#   perf      Performance improvement
#   test      Tests only
#   build     Build system or dependency change
#   ci        Continuous integration change
#   chore     Repository maintenance
#   revert    Revert an earlier commit
#
# Examples:
#   feat(desktop): add monitor input discovery
#   fix(sidecar): cancel pending bounce retries
#   docs: explain the release workflow
#
# Keep the summary imperative, specific, and free of a trailing period.
# Add a body below when the reason or migration impact is not obvious.
# Do not prefill bot attribution in this template.
